es their qualities, actions, or roles,&nbsp;<strong>not those of the reviewer.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Using the sliders below, rate how accurately <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b;\">the highlights<\/span> capture these references to people.<\/p>\n\n<hr \/>\n<div style=\"padding:10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<p><strong>Option A<\/strong><\/p>\n<span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;\">I was a bit busy the whole time that i was there so i didnt have much time to bond with the host, but the time that i did spend in the apt. was lovely<\/span>. I have nothing negative to say. <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;\">I think this place is wonderful, clean, and quite<\/span>.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":1,"CSSliderMax":7,"GridLines":6,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":0,"ShowValue":false,"CustomStart":true,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.31073446327683618140014232267276383936405181884765625,"2":0}},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the review carefully and look at the highlighted text. The highlighted parts are mean...","Choices":{"5":{"Display":"To what extent did it capture ALL relevant text?"},"6":{"Display":"To what extent did it AVOID highlighting irrelevant text?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["5","6"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":6,"Labels":{"2":{"Display":"Not at all"},"3":{"Display":"Moderately"},"5":{"Display":"Completely"}},"QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function() {\n    \n    console.log(\"Qualtrics Custom Slider Script: Starting for question \" + this.questionId);\n    \n    var questionId = '#' + this.questionId;\n    \n    \/\/ Let's try to find the top labels using a couple of common Qualtrics class names.\n    var topLabels = jQuery(questionId + ' .SL-Labels, ' + questionId + ' .SliderLabels');\n\n    if (topLabels.length > 0) {\n        console.log(\"SUCCESS: Found the top labels container.\", topLabels.get(0));\n\n        \/\/ Find each individual option\/statement in the question\n        var statements = jQuery(questionId + ' .ChoiceStructure li');\n\n        if (statements.length > 0) {\n            console.log(\"SUCCESS: Found \" + statements.length + \" statements to process.\");\n\n            statements.each(function() {\n                \/\/ Find the area within each statement to paste the labels into.\n                var inputContainer = jQuery(this).find('.Input, .InputCell'); \n                \n                if (inputContainer.length > 0) {\n                    var clonedLabels = topLabels.clone();\n                    inputContainer.append(clonedLabels);\n                    console.log(\"SUCCESS: Cloned and appended labels to a statement.\");\n                } else {\n                    console.error(\"ERROR: Could not find the '.Input' or '.InputCell' container inside a statement.\");\n                }\n            });\n\n            \/\/ Hide the original set of labels at the top\n            topLabels.first().hide();\n            console.log(\"SUCCESS: Script finished, original labels hidden.\");\n\n        } else {\n            console.error(\"ERROR: Could not find any statements to process. Looking for '.ChoiceStructure li'.\");\n        }\n    } else {\n        console.error(\"ERROR: Could not find the top labels container. Looking for '.SL-Labels' or '.SliderLabels'.\");\n    }\n});","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><mark>Please review the two options below and use the slider to rate the accuracy of the highlighting in each.<\/mark><\/p><hr> <div style=\"padding:10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6;\">   <p><strong>Option A<\/strong><\/p>   [name]'s apartment is very well located, just a few blocks from the 6 train. The area is safe, with lots of restaurants (just one block from the famous J.G. Melon) and take away places (starbucks, pain quotidien, pick a bagel).  The apartment is small but cosy, perfect for one person or a couple.  [name] couldn't be there, but her lovely parents were present to welcome me, despite the unsocial time I arrived. <span style='background-color:#d1ecf1; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;'>They were very nice and helpful<\/span>! I had a wonderful stay and would defenitly recommend this place. <\/div>\n","DataExportTag":"R3_A","QuestionID":"QID19"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_03d6DHX0CTW9l8W","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID2","SecondaryAttribute":"Original Review: [name] was really friendly and easy to approach. I agree that she is a tough mark...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Original Review:<\/strong><br>\nKaren was really friendly and easy to approach. I agree that she is a tough marker and expects you to have done your own readingsstudying, not just relying on the classes for your education. I think she stayed on target with the curriculum and was always willing to return to topics that we didn\\'t understand. She (I think) is underrated on here.<br><br><strong>Please carefully review the review above and choose the task result below&nbsp;that does the best in identifying sentences that mention human entities (e.g., hosts, instructors)&nbsp;based on your judgement.&nbsp;<\/strong><br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q2","QuestionID":"QID2","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Original Review: [name] was really friendly and easy to approach. I agree that she is a tough mark...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"i agree that she is a tough marker and expects you to have done your own readingsstudying, not just relying on the classes for your education., i think she stayed on target with the curriculum and was always willing to return to topics that we didn\\'t understand., she (i think) is underrated on here."},"2":{"Display":"[name] was really friendly and easy to approach .', 'I agree that she is a tough marker and expects you to have done your own readingsstudying , not just relying on the classes for your education .', \"I think she stayed on target with the curriculum and was always willing to return to topics that we didn\\\\'t understand ."}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":3}},{"SurveyID":"SV_03d6DHX0CTW9l8W","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID20","SecondaryAttribute":"Option B I was a bit busy the whole time that i was there so i didnt have much time to bond with...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"padding:10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6;\">   <p><strong>Option B<\/strong><\/p>   <span style='background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;'>I was a bit busy the whole time that i was there so i didnt have much time to bond with the host, but the time that i did spend in the apt<\/span>. was lovely. I have nothing negative to say. I think this place is wonderful, clean, and quite.  <\/div>\n","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":1,"CSSliderMax":7,"GridLines":6,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":false,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Option B I was a bit busy the whole time that i was there so i didnt have much time to bond with...","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"To what extent did it capture ALL relevant text?"},"5":{"Display":"To what extent did it AVOID highlighting irrelevant text?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Not at all"},"2":{"Display":"Moderately"},"3":{"Display":"Completely"}},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div style=\"padding:10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6;\">   <p><strong>Option B<\/strong><\/p>   [name]'s apartment is very well located, just a few blocks from the 6 train. The area is safe, with lots of restaurants (just one block from the famous J.G. <span style='background-color:#f8d7da; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;'>Melon) and take away places (starbucks, pain quotidien, pick a bagel<\/span>).  <span style='background-color:#f8d7da; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;'>The apartment is small but cosy, perfect for one person or a couple<\/span>.  [name] couldn't be there, but her lovely parents were present to welcome me, despite the unsocial time I arrived. <span style='background-color:#f8d7da; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;'>They were very nice and helpful<\/span>! I had a wonderful stay and would defenitly recommend this place. <\/div>\n","DataExportTag":"R3_B","QuestionID":"QID20"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_03d6DHX0CTW9l8W","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID21","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read the review carefully and look at the highlighted text. The highlighted parts are mean...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please read the review carefully and look at the <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b;\">highlighted text<\/span>. The <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b;\">highlighted parts<\/span> are meant to mark places where the review mentions a person (e.g., host, teacher) or describes their qualities, actions, or roles,&nbsp;<strong>not those of the reviewer.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Using the sliders below, rate how accurately <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b;\">the highlights<\/span> capture these references to people.<\/p>\n\n<hr>\n<div style=\"padding:10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<p><strong>Option A<\/strong><\/p>\nPleasantly surprise. He has a very diverse way of teaching and making everyone feel equal am part of a group. Public speaking is one of the most unnerving and challenging tasks many of us dread. <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;\">This instructor has a relaxed yet structured and fair manner in his approach<\/span>. <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;\">I highly recommend him<\/span>.Got much more out of this class than expected.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":1,"CSSliderMax":7,"GridLines":6,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":0,"ShowValue":false,"CustomStart":true,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.31073446327683618140014232267276383936405181884765625,"2":0}},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the review carefully and look at the highlighted text. The highlighted parts are mean...","Choices":{"5":{"Display":"To what extent did it capture ALL relevant text?"},"6":{"Display":"To what extent did it AVOID highlighting irrelevant text?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["5","6"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":6,"Labels":{"2":{"Display":"Not at all"},"3":{"Display":"Moderately"},"5":{"Display":"Completely"}},"QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function() {\n    \n    console.log(\"Qualtrics Custom Slider Script: Starting for question \" + this.questionId);\n    \n    var questionId = '#' + this.questionId;\n    \n    \/\/ Let's try to find the top labels using a couple of common Qualtrics class names.\n    var topLabels = jQuery(questionId + ' .SL-Labels, ' + questionId + ' .SliderLabels');\n\n    if (topLabels.length > 0) {\n        console.log(\"SUCCESS: Found the top labels container.\", topLabels.get(0));\n\n        \/\/ Find each individual option\/statement in the question\n        var statements = jQuery(questionId + ' .ChoiceStructure li');\n\n        if (statements.length > 0) {\n            console.log(\"SUCCESS: Found \" + statements.length + \" statements to process.\");\n\n            statements.each(function() {\n                \/\/ Find the area within each statement to paste the labels into.\n                var inputContainer = jQuery(this).find('.Input, .InputCell'); \n                \n                if (inputContainer.length > 0) {\n                    var clonedLabels = topLabels.clone();\n                    inputContainer.append(clonedLabels);\n                    console.log(\"SUCCESS: Cloned and appended labels to a statement.\");\n                } else {\n                    console.error(\"ERROR: Could not find the '.Input' or '.InputCell' container inside a statement.\");\n                }\n            });\n\n            \/\/ Hide the original set of labels at the top\n            topLabels.first().hide();\n            console.log(\"SUCCESS: Script finished, original labels hidden.\");\n\n        } else {\n            console.error(\"ERROR: Could not find any statements to process. Looking for '.ChoiceStructure li'.\");\n        }\n    } else {\n        console.error(\"ERROR: Could not find the top labels container. Looking for '.SL-Labels' or '.SliderLabels'.\");\n    }\n});","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><mark>Please review the two options below and use the slider to rate the accuracy of the highlighting in each.<\/mark><\/p><hr> <div style=\"padding:10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6;\">   <p><strong>Option A<\/strong><\/p>   <span style='background-color:#f8d7da; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;'>I was a bit busy the whole time that i was there so i didnt have much time to bond with the host, but the time that i did spend in the apt<\/span>. was lovely. I have nothing negative to say. I think this place is wonderful, clean, and quite.  <\/div>\n","DataExportTag":"R4_A","QuestionID":"QID21"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_03d6DHX0CTW9l8W","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID22","SecondaryAttribute":"Option B Pleasantly surprise.He has a very diverse way of teaching and making everyone feel equal...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"padding:10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6;\">   <p><strong>Option B<\/strong><\/p>   Pleasantly surprise.<span style='background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;'>He has a very diverse way of teaching and making everyone feel equal am part of a group<\/span>. Public speaking is one of the most unnerving and challenging tasks many of us dread. <span style='background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;'>This instructor has a relaxed yet structured and fair manner in his approach<\/span>. I highly recommend him.<span style='background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;'>Got much more out of this class than expected<\/span>. <\/div>\n","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":1,"CSSliderMax":7,"GridLin