n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Using the sliders below, rate how accurately <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b;\">the highlights<\/span> capture these references to people.<\/p>\n\n<hr \/>\n<div style=\"padding:10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<p><strong>Option A<\/strong><\/p>\nI had him for Statics. I started out with an A in his class for a month or so but my grade started to slip because I was being overwhelmed with the 4 other classes I had. <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;\">Mr. [name] is a really good teacher. He gives plenty of example problems on the board so we can understand what&#39;s going on. He provides his own scanned copies of his answer keys <\/span><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":1,"CSSliderMax":7,"GridLines":6,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":0,"ShowValue":false,"CustomStart":true,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.31073446327683618140014232267276383936405181884765625,"2":0}},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the review carefully and look at the highlighted text. The highlighted parts are mean...","Choices":{"5":{"Display":"To what extent did it capture ALL relevant text?"},"6":{"Display":"To what extent did it AVOID highlighting irrelevant text?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["5","6"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":6,"Labels":{"2":{"Display":"Not at all"},"3":{"Display":"Moderately"},"5":{"Display":"Completely"}},"QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function() {\n    \n    console.log(\"Qualtrics Custom Slider Script: Starting for question \" + this.questionId);\n    \n    var questionId = '#' + this.qu