cable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Option B I had him for Statics. I started out with an A in his class for a month or so but my gra...","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"To what extent did it capture ALL relevant text?"},"5":{"Display":"To what extent did it AVOID highlighting irrelevant text?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":4,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Not at all"},"2":{"Display":"Moderately"},"3":{"Display":"Completely"}},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div style=\"padding:10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6;\">   <p><strong>Option B<\/strong><\/p>   Pleasantly surprise.<span style='background-color:#d1ecf1; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;'>He has a very diverse way of teaching and making everyone feel equal am part of a group<\/span>. Public speaking is one of the most unnerving and challenging tasks many of us dread. <span style='background-color:#d1ecf1; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;'>This instructor has a relaxed yet structured and fair manner in his approach<\/span>. I highly recommend him.<span style='background-color:#d1ecf1; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;'>Got much more out of this class than expected<\/span>. <\/div>\n","DataExportTag":"R5_B","QuestionID":"QID24"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_03d6DHX0CTW9l8W","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID25","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read the review carefully and look at the highlighted text. The highlighted parts are mean...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please read the review carefully and look at the <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b;\">highlighted text<\/span>. The <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b;\">highlighted parts<\/span> are meant to mark places where the review mentions a person (e.g., host, teacher) or describes their qualities, actions, or roles,&nbsp;<strong>not those of the reviewer.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Using the sliders below, rate how accurately <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b;\">the highlights<\/span> capture these references to people.<\/p>\n\n<hr \/>\n<div style=\"padding:10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<p><strong>Option A<\/strong><\/p>\nProbably the worst teacher I have EVER had. <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;\">I took him for bio 101, you would think it&#39;d be easy.<\/span> <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;\">The average for the first two exams was a 65%.<\/span> <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;\">And to make things worst he whispers when he teachs, reads straight from the powerpoint and wears the same shark shirt everyday<\/span>! <span style=\"background-color:#fffb8b; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 4px;\">NEVER TAKE HIS CLASSSS<\/span>!<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":1,"CSSliderMax":7,"GridLines":6,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":0,"ShowValue":false,"CustomStart":true,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.31073446327683618140014232267276383936405181884765625,"2":0}},"QuestionDescription":"Please read the review carefully and look at the highlighted text. The highlighted parts are mean...","Choices":{"5":{"Display":"To what extent did it capture ALL relevant text?"},"6":{"Display":"To what extent did it AVOID highlighting irrelevant text?"}},"ChoiceOrder":["5","6"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"Nex